abstract: >-
  R pipeline and curated tables that harmonize literature-derived environmental
  antibiotic concentrations in China, CARSS clinical resistance panels, and
  China Statistical Yearbook covariates for province-level One Health reuse.
keywords:
  - antibiotics
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - China
  - environmental monitoring
  - One Health
  - CARSS
